[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3491024390","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112407#issuecomment-3491024390","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112407","id":3491024390,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QFM4G","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T12:46:01Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T12:57:51Z","body":"Thank you for your contribution, however this is not a format we use for documentation, nor is it something anyone has really asked for or something that's needed.\r\n\r\nGenerally (we are in the process of codifying our policy on generated content) we do not accept purely LLM generated content for various reasons (including practical and legal ones)\r\n\r\nJust from a glance (I haven't done anything beyond a basic glance) I can find several obvious errors just in the code and markdown, like invalid links linking to nowhere (`[Engine Initialization and Core Systems](#1.1)`, `[Platform Abstraction Layer](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4219ce91/1.3)`, etc.) or ones that are incorrectly formatted (`[platform/windows/detect.py:47-59]()`), it also seems to grab blocks of code at random with no logical grouping for the links. I assume this is because of unfamiliarity with the syntax and not because the content wasn't checked before posting and that the text itself is correct and that you have checked that it hasn't made any other mistakes?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3491024390/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3491459685","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112407#issuecomment-3491459685","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112407","id":3491459685,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QG3Jl","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T14:16:02Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T14:16:28Z","body":"I'm closing this as we have no intention of merging it.\n\nThank you for the effort, though. If you think it could be useful for people using the engine code, perhaps you'd like to upload it under your own account? Just make sure you clearly identify it as AI generated content.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3491459685/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3494428066","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112407#issuecomment-3494428066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112407","id":3494428066,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QSL2i","user":{"login":"hayden3456","id":67346045,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzQ2MDQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67346045?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hayden3456","html_url":"https://github.com/hayden3456","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hayden3456/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hayden3456/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hayden3456/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hayden3456/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hayden3456/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hayden3456/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hayden3456/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hayden3456/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hayden3456/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-06T01:44:45Z","updated_at":"2025-11-06T01:44:45Z","body":"@AThousandShips + @Ivorforce You are absolutely right that t